## the after-an-attack extraction as the guide prints it: the same archive, deploy.key* left out of the extraction
$ sudo tar -xzf etc-hotserve.tar.gz -C /etc --exclude="hotserve/deploy.key*"   (the guide quotes the pattern with single quotes; here -C $d/new, no sudo)
$ find new/hotserve | sort
new/hotserve
new/hotserve/Caddyfile
new/hotserve/demo.env
new/hotserve/secrets
new/hotserve/secrets/demo.env
